cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use MoSim, please cite the MASCOTS 2026 paper below. Note that the
  first three authors contributed equally; the Citation File Format has no
  field for that, so it is recorded here.
title: MoSim
# Describes the software artifact. The paper's own abstract is verbatim under
# `preferred-citation.abstract` below.
abstract: >-
  Rust and Python implementation of MoSim, the GPU-cluster simulator from the
  MASCOTS 2026 paper below, together with the job traces, single-job profiles,
  physical-testbed ground truth, and scripts that reproduce Tables II-IV.
